Test: NSTableView

Version: 1.0

Description:
Tests for NSTableView behavior, including column management, selection,
notifications, rendering, state, and prototype view registration.

Tests:
  click - Tests row clicking behavior
  columnNotification - Tests column notification behavior
  columnSelectionDefault - Tests default column selection behavior
  columns - Tests column management and prototype view registration
  gridStyle - Tests grid style behavior
  indicatorImage - Tests indicator image behavior
  rendering - Tests table rendering behavior
  selection - Tests row selection behavior
  selectionNotification - Tests selection notification behavior
  state - Tests NSTableView scalar state

Author: GNUstep
